      "league_fiora": {
        "name": "Fiora",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Duelist's Dance<>: every <#ffb900ff>3s<> her hit on an enemy champion reveals a <#ff9028ff>Vital<>; her next champion hit strikes it for <#f5f5f5ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#f5f5f5ff>10% AD<> + <#f5f5f5ff>4%<> of max health as <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<>, healing her <#6aff55ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#6aff55ff>15% AD<> and granting <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>60% Move Speed<> (decaying).",
        "skill": "<#ff9028ff>Lunge<>: Fiora dashes at an enemy (champions first) and stabs for <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Bladework<> (every <#ffb900ff>8s<>): her next two attacks gain <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>50% Attack Speed<>; the first <#ef5350ff>slows by 30%<>, the second critically strikes for <#ff9028ff>160% AD<>.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Riposte<>: Fiora parries for <#ffb900ff>0.75s<> (every hit deals her 1 damage, immune to crowd control), then stabs forward for <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to enemies in a line. The first enemy champion is <#ef5350ff>slowed by 50%<>, or <#ef5350ff>stunned<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<> if she parried any damage.",
        "ult": "<#ff9028ff>Grand Challenge<>: reveals <#ffb900ff>4<> <#ff9028ff>Vitals<> on an enemy champion for <#ffb900ff>8s<>, grants <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>20% Move Speed<> and starts <#ff9028ff>Bladework<>. Each of her champion hits strikes one and <#ffb900ff>halves Q's and W's cooldowns<>. Striking all 4, or the target dying after one is struck, leaves a <#6aff55ff>Victory Zone<> healing allies in it <#6aff55ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#6aff55ff>24% AD<> per second for <#ffb900ff>3s<>."
      },
      "league_fizz": {
        "name": "Fizz",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and make the target bleed for <#a974ffff>18<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>18% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> over <#ffb900ff>3s<> (stacking). Passive <#ff9028ff>Nimble Fighter<>: Fizz takes <#ffffffff>12%<> less damage from basic attacks. <#ff9028ff>Combo Q E / R E<>: Playful cast within <#ffb900ff>1s<> of Urchin Strike going through a champion, or while the fish sticks to one, jumps at once.",
        "skill": "<#a974ffff>Urchin Strike<>: Fizz dashes through the target, dealing <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> plus <#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>65% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and the bleed. <#a974ffff>Seastone Trident<> (every <#ffb900ff>6s<>): his next basic attack or Urchin Strike deals <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60% AP<> bonus <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; if it kills the target the cooldown drops to <#ffb900ff>1s<>.",
        "skill2": "<#a974ffff>Playful / Trickster<>: Fizz vaults onto his trident for <#ffb900ff>0.63s<> (hits deal him 1, immune to crowd control), then slams down on the nearest enemy, dealing <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> around him and <#ef5350ff>slowing by 40%<> for <#ffb900ff>2s<>. With enemy champions near he waits (up to <#ffb900ff>1s<>) and vaults the moment he is hit, dodging what follows.",
        "ult": "<#a974ffff>Chum the Waters<>: Fizz throws a fish that sticks to the first enemy champion and slows it; <#ffb900ff>2s<> later a shark bursts up under it, <#ef5350ff>knocking up<> nearby enemies for <#ffb900ff>1s<> and dealing <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. Farther fish, bigger shark: <#a974ffff>150/220/300<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70/90/110% AP<>, <#ef5350ff>slow 40/60/80%<>. A miss calls the big shark where the fish lands."
      },
      "league_shaco": {
        "name": "Shaco",
        "attack": "Dagger stabs. Passive <#ff9028ff>Backstab<>: attacks on crowd-controlled enemy champions deal <#ff9028ff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>25% AD<> bonus <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Two-Shiv Poison<>: every <#ffb900ff>8s<> his next attack throws a shiv instead, dealing <#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and <#ef5350ff>slowing<> by 30%.",
        "skill": "Shaco vanishes and blinks behind his target, <#ffb900ff>invisible for 1.5s<>. His next attack is a backstab that <#ff9028ff>always critically strikes<>: <#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>85% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, doubled by the crit.",
        "skill2": "Shaco throws a Jack-in-the-Box at an enemy's feet. It springs open, <#ef5350ff>fearing<> enemy champions around it for <#ffb900ff>1s<> (minions and monsters <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>), then fires at every enemy nearby every <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> for <#ffb900ff>5s<>, dealing <#a974ffff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>12% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> per shot.",
        "ult": "Shaco briefly vanishes and a clone appears behind an enemy champion for <#ffb900ff>5s<>, backstabbing it whenever Shaco attacks for <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. When it ends or the target dies it explodes for <#a974ffff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, releasing three mini boxes that <#ef5350ff>fear<> nearby enemies."
      },
      "league_caitlyn": {
        "name": "Caitlyn",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Headshot<>: every <#ffb900ff>6<>th shot deals <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>180% AD<>; a trapped champion within <#ffb900ff>1.5x<> <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:range_0>range is shot first, +<#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40% AD<>. <#ff9028ff>90 Caliber Net<>: an enemy champion on her gets a net instead: <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60% AD<>, a <#ef5350ff>50% slow<>; she hops back and her next shot is a Headshot (<#ffb900ff>12s<> cooldown).",
        "skill": "After aiming, Caitlyn fires a piercing round at the spot she locked (an enemy champion first; he can step aside): <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>110% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to the first enemy hit, <#ffb900ff>60%<> of it to the others.",
        "skill2": "Caitlyn throws traps at an enemy champion (<#ffb900ff>3<> charges, one every <#ffb900ff>12s<>): the first at his feet, the others spread between them, lasting <#ffb900ff>8s<>. The first enemy champion to step on it is <#ef5350ff>rooted<> for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> and Caitlyn headshots him.",
        "ult": "Caitlyn lines up a shot on an enemy champion for <#ffb900ff>1s<> (crowd control breaks it), then fires: the first enemy champion in the bullet's path takes <#ff9028ff>250<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>150% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>."
      },
      "league_nocturne": {
        "name": "Nocturne",
        "attack": "Blade strikes. Passive <#ff9028ff>Umbra Blades<>: every <#ffb900ff>12s<> or every <#ffb900ff>4th<> attack, his attack cleaves all nearby enemies for <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>120% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and heals him for <#6aff55ff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#6aff55ff>20% AP<> per enemy hit.",
        "skill": "Nocturne throws a shadow blade, dealing <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>85% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to enemies in its path and leaving a Dusk Trail for <#ffb900ff>5s<>; enemy champions hit leave a trail too. On a trail he gains <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>25% Move Speed<> and <#ff9028ff>15% AD<>.",
        "skill2": "Nocturne tethers his target for <#ffb900ff>2s<>, dealing <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>120% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; if it is still near at the end it is <#ef5350ff>feared<> for <#ffb900ff>1.33s<> and he chases with <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>40% Move Speed<>. He also raises <#ff9028ff>Shroud of Darkness<> for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>: ability damage drops to 1 and he is immune to crowd control; if he is hit meanwhile he gains <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>40% attack speed<> for <#ffb900ff>5s<>.",
        "ult": "Darkness falls: every allied champion turns <#ffb900ff>invisible while Nocturne flies and lands<> (enemies see only what is next to them), and Nocturne flies at an enemy champion, dealing <#ff9028ff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>120% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> on landing. He is immune to crowd control in flight."
      },
      "league_blitzcrank": {
        "name": "Blitzcrank",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>; while Static Field is off cooldown, lightning strikes the target <#ffb900ff>1s<> later for <#a974ffff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>15% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. Passive <#e8d44dff>Mana Barrier<>: when surrounded or crowd-controlled he gains a <#e8d44dff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80% AP<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> (<#ffb900ff>60s<> cooldown).",
        "skill": "Blitzcrank fires his hand at the first enemy champion in a line (it passes minions), dealing <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, <#ef5350ff>stunning<> it and pulling it to him.",
        "skill2": "An uppercut dealing <#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and <#ef5350ff>knocking up<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<>. <#ff9028ff>Overdrive<> (every <#ffb900ff>15s<>): when enemy champions come near he gains +40% decaying move speed and +25% attack speed for <#ffb900ff>4s<>, then is <#ef5350ff>slowed by 25%<> for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>.",
        "ult": "Blitzcrank discharges, dealing <#a974ffff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to nearby enemies and <#ef5350ff>silencing<> enemy champions for <#ffb900ff>1s<>. Used once a fight is on; afterwards the attacks' lightning stops until Static Field is off cooldown."
      },
      "league_camille": {
        "name": "Camille",
        "attack": "Blade kicks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Adaptive Defenses<>: every <#ffb900ff>10s<> her kick on an enemy champion grants a <#e8d44dff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#e8d44dff>80% AD<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> for <#ffb900ff>2s<>. <#ff9028ff>Precision Protocol<> (every <#ffb900ff>7s<>): her next kick deals <#ff9028ff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30% AD<> more and grants <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>Move Speed<>; the next kick after a <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> charge deals double the bonus, <#f5f5f5ff>50%<> as <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<>.",
        "skill": "<#ff9028ff>Tactical Sweep<>: Camille winds up and slices in a cone toward her target for <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Enemies hit by the outer edge take <#ff9028ff>5%<> of their max health more and are <#ef5350ff>slowed by 80%<> (decaying over 2s); she heals <#6aff55ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#6aff55ff>20% AD<> per enemy champion hit by the edge.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Hookshot<>: Camille hooks a minion, monster or tower near an enemy champion (never a champion) and is pulled to it, then dashes at a nearby enemy champion, dealing <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> around her, <#ef5350ff>stunning<> it for <#ffb900ff>0.75s<> and gaining <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>50% Attack Speed<> for <#ffb900ff>5s<>. Outnumbered, she hooks one away from enemies and dashes off instead.",
        "ult": "<#ff9028ff>The Hextech Ultimatum<>: Camille leaps onto an enemy champion (immune to damage and crowd control in the air), knocks the others away and raises a fixed field where she lands for <#ffb900ff>3s<>: the target cannot dash or walk out of it; she can leave, which ends it. Her kicks on champions meanwhile deal <#f5f5f5ff>10<> + <#f5f5f5ff>3%<> of max health as <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<>."
      },
      "league_sona": {
        "name": "Sona",
        "attack": "Note shots. Passive <#ff9028ff>Power Chord<>: after every <#ffb900ff>3<> spells her next attack deals <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50% AP<> bonus <#a974ffff>magic damage<> plus the last song's effect: Staccato doubles it, Diminuendo makes the target deal <#ffb900ff>25%<> less damage for 3s, Tempo <#ef5350ff>slows<> it by 40% for 2s.",
        "skill": "Sona deals <#a974ffff>95<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to each of the two nearest enemies, champions first. <#ff9028ff>Melody<>: allied champions who come near her within <#ffb900ff>3s<> gain <#ff9028ff>15% AD<> and <#a974ffff>15% AP<> for <#ffb900ff>3s<>.",
        "skill2": "Sona heals herself and a nearby allied champion for <#6aff55ff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#6aff55ff>40% AP<>. <#ff9028ff>Melody<>: allied champions near her gain a <#e8d44dff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#e8d44dff>40% AP<> shield for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>. Every <#ffb900ff>14s<> she also plays <#ff9028ff>Song of Celerity<>: allied champions near her gain <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>20% Move Speed<> (30% for herself) for <#ffb900ff>3s<>.",
        "ult": "Sona strikes a chord at an enemy champion: a wave that deals <#a974ffff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to every enemy champion it passes and <#ef5350ff>stuns<> them for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>. Passive: once she has cast it in a life, her basic spells' cooldowns are <#ffb900ff>20%<> shorter."
      },
      "league_leblanc": {
        "name": "LeBlanc",
        "attack": "Passive <#ff9028ff>Mirror Image<>: when two or more enemy champions close in, she turns <#ffb900ff>invisible for 1s<>, slips back and leaves a clone (every <#ffb900ff>40s<>). <#ff9028ff>Ethereal Chains<>: every <#ffb900ff>10s<> her next attack on a champion is a chain: <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; held while she stays near, after <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>: <#ef5350ff>rooted 1.5s<>, <#a974ffff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100% AP<> more.",
        "skill": "LeBlanc projects a sigil, dealing <#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and marking the target for <#ffb900ff>3.5s<>; her next ability that hits detonates it for <#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% AP<>. If it hits a champion while <#ff9028ff>Distortion<> is ready, she follows up with it at once (combo).",
        "skill2": "LeBlanc dashes to an enemy champion, dealing <#a974ffff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to enemies around her, and <#ffb900ff>0.93s<> later blinks back to where she started (not while crowd-controlled).",
        "ult": "LeBlanc casts her last ability again, stronger: the sigil <#a974ffff>160<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>110% AP<> (and as much when detonated), Distortion <#a974ffff>220<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>150% AP<>, the chain <#a974ffff>130<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>90% AP<> and <#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>150% AP<> on rooting."
      },
      "league_kaisa": {
        "name": "Kai'Sa",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Second Skin<>: hits on a champion add Plasma (2 if crowd-controlled), each dealing <#a974ffff>18 + 9/stack<> magic damage; the 5th ruptures for <#f5f5f5ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#f5f5f5ff>60% AD<> + <#f5f5f5ff>15% max health<> true damage. <#ff9028ff>Supercharge<>: every <#ffb900ff>8s<> her first champion hit hastes her, then <#ffb900ff>+90%<> attack speed for <#ffb900ff>4s<> (level 9+: <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> invisible).",
        "skill": "Kai'Sa fires <#ffb900ff>6<> missiles at nearby enemies (the first at her target), each dealing <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Living Weapon<>: with <#ffb900ff>200<> attack it fires <#ffb900ff>12<>, <#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>34% AD<> each.",
        "skill2": "Kai'Sa locks on an enemy champion and fires a long-range void bolt (dodgeable before it fires) that passes minions: the first champion hit takes <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>150% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and <#ffb900ff>2<> Plasma. <#ff9028ff>Living Weapon<>: from level 12, <#ffb900ff>3<> Plasma and <#ffb900ff>75%<> of the cooldown back.",
        "ult": "Kai'Sa dashes to an enemy champion damaged lately and lands with a <#ffb900ff>220<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ffb900ff>180% AD<> shield for <#ffb900ff>2s<>."
      },
      "league_ryze": {
        "name": "Ryze",
        "attack": "Rune orb shots. Passive <#ff9028ff>Arcane Mastery<>: all his spells deal bonus damage equal to <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#6aff55ff>2% of his max Health<> (TFM2 has no mana; health stands in for it).",
        "skill": "Ryze unleashes a blast that deals <#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to the first enemy hit. If any enemies carry <#ff9028ff>Flux<>, the hit makes all of them take <#a974ffff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>35% AP<> bounce damage and uses the Flux up.",
        "skill2": "Combo E-W-Q-E-Q: <#ff9028ff>Spell Flux<> deals <#a974ffff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>45% AP<> and puts <#ff9028ff>Flux<> on the target and enemies near it for <#ffb900ff>4s<>; <#ff9028ff>Rune Prison<> deals <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>55% AP<> and <#ef5350ff>roots<> for <#ffb900ff>1.25s<> while Flux is up (slows otherwise); <#ff9028ff>Overload<> bursts the Flux, then a second <#ff9028ff>Spell Flux<> and <#ff9028ff>Overload<>; the runes give him <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>30% Move Speed<>.",
        "ult": "Ryze opens a portal to flee when enemy champions close in, or to chase a foe leaving his range with an ally along, outside teamfights, landing at casting range. After <#ffb900ff>1s<> he warps with the allies in it, then throws a <#ff9028ff>Spell Flux<>. Crowd control breaks it. Passive: once cast in a life, the Flux bounce deals <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>55% AP<>."
      },
      "league_kennen": {
        "name": "Kennen",
        "attack": "Throws shurikens. Passive <#ff9028ff>Mark of the Storm<>: his abilities mark the champions they hit; the third mark <#ef5350ff>stuns for 1.25s<> (0.5s if stunned within 7s). <#ff9028ff>Electrical Surge<>: every fifth attack deals <#a974ffff>48<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% AP<> bonus <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and marks.",
        "skill": "Kennen hurls a shuriken (the aim is set before it leaves, so it can be dodged): the first enemy hit takes <#a974ffff>95<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>90% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. If it hits a champion while <#ff9028ff>Electrical Surge<> is ready, he surges at once (combo).",
        "skill2": "Kennen turns into lightning and rushes through enemies, dealing <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% AP<> to each one he passes; at the end he releases <#ff9028ff>Electrical Surge<> (<#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80% AP<> around him) and gains 50% attack speed for <#ffb900ff>4s<>. With his ultimate ready he goes straight into it (combo).",
        "ult": "Kennen summons a storm that follows him for <#ffb900ff>3s<>, striking enemy champions inside it every 0.5s for <#a974ffff>52<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and a mark; he gains 25 armor and magic resist meanwhile."
      },
      "league_jhin": {
        "name": "Jhin",
        "attack": "Passive <#ff9028ff>Whisper<>: four shots a round; the fourth always <#ff9028ff>crits<> and adds <#ffb900ff>10%<> of the target's max health, then Jhin reloads for <#ffb900ff>2.17s<> (he can move and cast meanwhile) and gains <#ffb900ff>25%<> move speed. Champions he kills bloom a lotus where they fall.",
        "skill": "Jhin throws a grenade that bounces from its target to the enemies behind it, up to <#ffb900ff>4<> hits, each dealing <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>; every unit it kills adds <#ffb900ff>35%<> to the hits after it.",
        "skill2": "With <#ff9028ff>Captive Audience<> ready, Jhin first plants a lotus at an enemy champion's feet: stepped on, it <#ef5350ff>slows by 35%<> and bursts <#ffb900ff>2s<> later for <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>120%<>. Then he fires a very long shot: the first enemy champion hit takes <#ff9028ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90%<> and is <#ef5350ff>rooted for 1.67s<> if Jhin's team damaged him lately.",
        "ult": "Jhin sets up and fires <#ffb900ff>4<> very long shots, each aimed before it leaves (crowd control breaks the channel): the first enemy champion in its path takes <#ff9028ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>55%<> and is <#ef5350ff>slowed by 80%<>; every hit adds <#ffb900ff>30%<> to the shots after it, and the fourth deals double."
      },
      "league_zilean": {
        "name": "Zilean",
        "attack": "Fires time orbs. Passive <#ff9028ff>Time In A Bottle<>: every <#ffb900ff>90s<> a bottle fills; his next <#ff9028ff>Time Warp<> on an allied champion hands it over: that ally and Zilean each gain <#ff9028ff>10 attack<>, <#a974ffff>10 AP<> and <#6aff55ff>80 health<> until they die.",
        "skill": "Zilean lobs a bomb at the target's feet (aimed on release: dodgeable). It sticks to the first enemy near it (champions first) and explodes after <#ffb900ff>3s<> for <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Rewind<> (every <#ffb900ff>12s<>): on a champion he turns time back and throws another - both explode at once and <#ef5350ff>stun for 1.25s<>; cooldowns shorten.",
        "skill2": "Zilean <#ef5350ff>slows<> an enemy champion by <#ef5350ff>35%<> and grants an allied champion beside him (himself if alone) <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>35% move speed<> for <#ffb900ff>2.5s<>.",
        "ult": "When an allied champion near him is crowd-controlled, or two enemy champions close in on Zilean, he places a time rune on them: they cannot die for <#ffb900ff>5s<>, then time rewinds and they heal <#6aff55ff>400<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#6aff55ff>150% AP<>."
      },
      "league_vi": {
        "name": "Vi",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Denting Blows<>: every 3rd attack deals <#ff9028ff>20<> more (+<#ff9028ff>5% max health<> to champions), shreds <#ffb900ff>20%<> armour and gives <#ffb900ff>+30%<> attack speed for <#ffb900ff>4s<>. <#ff9028ff>Blast Shield<>: a spell hit shields her for <#ffb900ff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ffb900ff>60% AD<> (<#ffb900ff>3s<>, <#ffb900ff>12s<> cooldown, <#ffb900ff>-3s<> per 3rd attack).",
        "skill": "Vi charges for <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> (the aim locks as she starts), then dashes ahead dealing <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to enemies on the way; the first champion stops her and is knocked back (a Denting Blows stack). For <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> after, Relentless Force punches at once.",
        "skill2": "<#ffb900ff>2<> charges (<#ffb900ff>8s<> each). Her next attack becomes Relentless Force: <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>110% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to the target and enemies in a cone behind it.",
        "ult": "Vi targets an enemy champion and charges, immune to crowd control; enemies in the way take <#ff9028ff>75<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and are stunned <#ffb900ff>0.75s<>. On arrival the target is knocked up <#ffb900ff>1.25s<> for <#ff9028ff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>120% AD<>; her next attack is a Relentless Force."
      },
      "league_kayn": {
        "name": "Kayn",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Darkin Scythe<>: <#fffffffe><>spell hits on nearby champions charge the <#fe5c50ff>Darkin<> (<#ffb900ff>2<>), W hits only on far ones the <#8484fbff>Shadow<> (<#ffb900ff>1<>); the first full one is his form until death<#ffffffff><>. <#fe5c50ff>Darkin<>: heals <#ffb900ff>20%<> of damage to champions. <#8484fbff>Shadow<>: for <#ffb900ff>3s<> into a fight, hits on champions deal <#ffb900ff>8<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ffb900ff>15%<> true damage more.",
        "skill": "Kayn dashes at the target and spins his scythe; the dash and the spin each deal <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>55% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> (<#fe5c50ff>Darkin<>: +<#ff9028ff>4% max health<> to champions). <#ff9028ff>Shadow Step<>: then <#ffb900ff>+35%<> move speed (<#8484fbff>Shadow<> <#ffb900ff>+55%<>) for <#ffb900ff>2s<> and heals <#ffb900ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ffb900ff>20%<>.",
        "skill2": "Kayn raises his scythe for <#ffb900ff>0.55s<> (the aim locks as he raises it), then slashes a line ahead: <#ff9028ff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and a decaying <#ffb900ff>50%<> slow. <#fe5c50ff>Darkin<>: knocks up for <#ffb900ff>0.75s<>. <#8484fbff>Shadow<>: longer reach.",
        "ult": "Kayn infests an enemy champion his team damaged recently, untargetable for <#ffb900ff>2s<>, then bursts out for <#ff9028ff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>150% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. <#fe5c50ff>Darkin<>: +<#ff9028ff>10% max health<>, healing <#ffb900ff>70%<> of it. <#8484fbff>Shadow<>: his fight-start bonus opens again."
      },
      "league_aatrox": {
        "name": "Aatrox",
        "attack": "Passive <#ff9028ff>Deathbringer Stance<>: every <#ffb900ff>10s<> an attack deals <#ffb900ff>25<> more and <#ffb900ff>6%<> of a champion's max health and <#4caf50ff>heals<> him; each hit on a champion takes 2s off the wait, an edge hit 4s. He <#4caf50ff>heals 18%<> of the damage he deals to champions.",
        "skill": "Aatrox slams his greatsword up to three times, each with a new shape and +<#ffb900ff>25%<> damage: <#ff9028ff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>160%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>; enemies hit by the edge take <#ffb900ff>60%<> more and are <#ef5350ff>knocked up<>. With <#ff9028ff>Umbral Dash<> ready he first dashes to put a champion on the edge.",
        "skill2": "Aatrox fires a chain: the first enemy hit takes <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>; a champion it hits is chained: <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> later it is <#ef5350ff>pulled back<> and hit again.",
        "ult": "Aatrox reveals his demonic form for <#ffb900ff>10s<>: nearby minions and monsters are <#ef5350ff>feared<>, he gains <#ffb900ff>25%<> attack damage, <#4caf50ff>50%<> more self-healing and <#ffb900ff>45%<> move speed that decays. Champion kills refresh it."
      },
      "league_sivir": {
        "name": "Sivir",
        "attack": "Passive <#ff9028ff>Fleet of Foot<>: hitting a champion with an attack or a spell gives <#ffb900ff>25%<> move speed, fading over 2s. <#ff9028ff>Ricochet<>: every <#ffb900ff>10s<> her next attack starts <#ffb900ff>4s<> of Ricochet: +<#ffb900ff>45%<> attack speed, and each attack also bounces to up to <#ffb900ff>3<> enemies behind its target for <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> physical damage (can crit).",
        "skill": "Sivir hurls her crossblade: it flies to the end of its path and back to her hand, dealing <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to every enemy it cuts through on both passes. With a champion in reach she throws it where he stands (aimed before it leaves: it can be dodged).",
        "skill2": "Sivir raises a spell shield for up to <#ffb900ff>3s<>: <#ef5350ff>immune to spell damage and crowd control<>. The first hit she takes heals her for <#7ed957ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7ed957ff>40%<> and triggers Fleet of Foot; the shield breaks <#ffb900ff>1s<> later.",
        "ult": "Nearby allied champions, Sivir included, gain <#ffb900ff>30%<> move speed for <#ffb900ff>8s<>. While she hunts, her attacks that hit champions take time off Boomerang Blade and Spell Shield, Ricochet comes back twice as fast, and a champion her attack kills renews the hunt."
      },
      "league_twistedfate": {
        "name": "Twisted Fate",
        "attack": "Throws cards. Passive <#ff9028ff>Loaded Dice<>: a unit killed by his attack or Wild Cards rolls a die, the face giving a little <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>Ability Power<> until he dies. <#ff9028ff>Stacked Deck<>: every 4th attack deals <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> bonus <#a974ffff>magic damage<>.",
        "skill": "Twisted Fate throws three cards, dealing <#a974ffff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to each enemy they pass through. The aim is set as he throws, so they can be dodged.",
        "skill2": "Blue, red and gold cards cycle over his head; he locks the one he wants as it comes up and his next attack throws it (plus <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<>): <#ff9028ff>Blue<> <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100%<> and halves his spell cooldowns; <#ff9028ff>Red<> <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> around the target and <#ef5350ff>slows<>; <#ff9028ff>Gold<> <#a974ffff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> and <#ef5350ff>stuns<> for <#ffb900ff>1.67s<>.",
        "ult": "<#ff9028ff>Destiny<>: every enemy champion is marked. <#ff9028ff>Gate<>: after a <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> channel (crowd control breaks it) he teleports beside a distant enemy champion his team is fighting and lands with a <#ff9028ff>Gold Card<> locked. Used only when no enemy is near him."
      },
      "league_rakan": {
        "name": "Rakan",
        "attack": "Throws a feather. Passive <#ff9028ff>Fey Feathers<>: Rakan holds a <#e8d44dff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#e8d44dff>70% AP<> <#e8d44dff>shield<>; <#ffb900ff>12s<> after it breaks it comes back, <#ffb900ff>1s<> sooner for every attack or ability that hits an enemy champion.",
        "skill": "Rakan flings a feather: the first enemy hit takes <#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. After a champion hit he <#6aff55ff>heals<> himself and nearby allied champions for <#6aff55ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#6aff55ff>50% AP<> after <#ffb900ff>3s<>, or as soon as he touches an ally.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Grand Entrance<>: Rakan dashes onto an enemy champion and spirals up, <#ef5350ff>knocking up<> the enemies around him for <#ffb900ff>0.8s<> and dealing <#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; then <#ff9028ff>Battle Dance<>: he flies to the nearest allied champion and gives him a <#e8d44dff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#e8d44dff>70% AP<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> for <#ffb900ff>3s<>.",
        "ult": "For <#ffb900ff>4s<> Rakan <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>darts<> through the enemy team: every enemy he touches takes <#a974ffff>140<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and is <#ef5350ff>charmed for 1.25s<> (once each). The first champion he touches speeds him up."
      },
      "league_evelynn": {
        "name": "Evelynn",
        "attack": "Lashes. <#ff9028ff>Demon Shade<>: after <#ffb900ff>4s<> without attacks or spells (Allure excepted) she regenerates and, from level 5, is camouflaged. <#ff9028ff>Whiplash<>: every <#ffb900ff>8s<> her attack whips for <#a974ffff>40<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> and <#ffffffff>3%<> max health and speeds her up; out of the Shade it dashes to the target, hitting all in between.",
        "skill": "Her lasher hits the first enemy for <#a974ffff>45<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>35%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and her next 3 attacks deal <#a974ffff>15<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>20%<> more. Then 3 spikes fire by themselves (champions first), each dealing <#a974ffff>30<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>25%<> to the enemies on its line.",
        "skill2": "Marks an enemy (champions first) without breaking her Shade. After <#ffb900ff>2.5s<> her next hit <#ef5350ff>charms<> it: champions <#ffb900ff>1.25s<> and <#a974ffff>-35% magic resist<>, monsters <#ffb900ff>3s<> and <#a974ffff>150<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<>.",
        "ult": "Readied, cast once she has hit champions a few times or is surrounded: a cone of <#a974ffff>150<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>75%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, +<#ffb900ff>35%<> for each recent champion hit (up to x2.4); she is <#ef5350ff>untargetable<>, warps back and soon returns to the Shade."
      },
      "league_sett": {
        "name": "Sett",
        "attack": "Passive <#ff9028ff>Pit Grit<>: Sett's punches alternate left and right. The right punch lands sooner and deals <#ff9028ff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>20% AD<> more <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>; after <#ffb900ff>2s<> without a punch he starts again with the left. He has high <#6aff55ff>health regeneration<>.",
        "skill": "Sett pulls in every enemy around him for <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>: two or more are <#ef5350ff>stunned<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<>, one is <#ef5350ff>slowed<> by <#ffb900ff>50%<>. His next two punches (<#ff9028ff>Knuckle Down<>) deal <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>20% AD<> + <#ffb900ff>4%<> of the target's max health more and he gains <#ffb900ff>30%<> move speed. For <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> after it <#ef5350ff>stuns<> a champion, Haymaker's whole fist deals <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<>.",
        "skill2": "Passive: Sett gains a level of <#e8d44dff>Grit<> while taking damage (up to <#ffb900ff>5<>, lost after <#ffb900ff>4s<>). He spends it on a <#e8d44dff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#e8d44dff>20% AD<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> and winds up a punch: <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>; enemies in the middle also take <#f5f5f5ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#f5f5f5ff>30% AD<> <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<>. Each level of Grit adds <#e8d44dff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#e8d44dff>25% AD<> shield and <#f5f5f5ff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#f5f5f5ff>8% AD<> true damage.",
        "ult": "Sett grabs an enemy champion (<#ef5350ff>stunned<>), hurls it and slams down on it: enemies nearby take <#ff9028ff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> + <#ffb900ff>4%<> of their max health as <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and are <#ef5350ff>slowed<> by <#ffb900ff>99%<> for <#ffb900ff>0.5s<>; the thrown one takes <#ffb900ff>6%<> of its max health more. For <#ffb900ff>2.5s<> after the slam, Facebreaker always <#ef5350ff>stuns<> and Haymaker's whole fist deals <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<>."
      },
      "league_lissandra": {
        "name": "Lissandra",
        "attack": "Throws ice bolts. Passive <#ff9028ff>Iceborn Subjugation<>: an enemy champion she kills becomes a frozen thrall that shatters after <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>, dealing <#a974ffff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> around it and <#ef5350ff>slowing<>.",
        "skill": "Throws a shard of ice that deals <#a974ffff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to every enemy it passes and <#ef5350ff>slows<> them by 25%. The aim is set as she throws, so it can be dodged.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Ring of Frost<>: enemies around her take <#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and are <#ef5350ff>rooted<> for <#ffb900ff>1.25s<>. With no enemy near, <#ff9028ff>Glacial Path<> first: a claw dealing <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<>; she blinks after it to an enemy champion her team is fighting and casts the ring there.",
        "ult": "Encases an enemy champion: <#ef5350ff>stunned<> for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>, <#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. Surrounded by two or more enemy champions, she encases herself instead for <#ffb900ff>2.5s<>: immune to damage and crowd control, healing <#7cfc00ff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7cfc00ff>80%<>. The ice leaves a slowing field around the tomb."
      },
      "league_alistar": {
        "name": "Alistar",
        "attack": "Pounds with both fists. Passive <#ff9028ff>Triumphant Roar<>: after his crowd control lands on enemy champions <#ffb900ff>3 times<> he roars, healing himself <#7cfc00ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7cfc00ff>20%<> and allied champions nearby <#7cfc00ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7cfc00ff>30%<>.",
        "skill": "<#ff9028ff>Trample<> into <#ff9028ff>Pulverize<>: he tramples for <#ffb900ff>3s<> (<#a974ffff>8<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>6%<> a stomp), then smashes the ground: <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and a <#ef5350ff>1s knock-up<> around him. After <#ffb900ff>5<> stomps on champions his next attack <#ef5350ff>stuns<> for 1s.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Headbutt<> into <#ff9028ff>Pulverize<>: charges an enemy champion, knocks him back for <#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, then smashes the ground, <#ef5350ff>knocking up<> enemies around him. Starts Trample too.",
        "ult": "Roars in a fight: <#ef5350ff>immune to crowd control<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<>, takes <#ffb900ff>50%<> less damage for <#ffb900ff>7s<>."
      },
      "league_varus": {
        "name": "Varus",
        "attack": "Shoots arrows dealing <#a974ffff>20 magic damage<> on hit; each champion hit adds a stack of <#ff9028ff>Blight<> (up to 3). Passive <#ff9028ff>Living Vengeance<>: a champion kill gives <#ffb900ff>+60%<> attack speed, a minion or monster kill <#ffb900ff>+20%<>, for 5s.",
        "skill": "Draws and fires a piercing arrow: fully charged with an enemy champion in reach for <#ff9028ff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>130%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, else a quick weaker shot; each further enemy takes less. A champion hit bursts Blight: <#ffffffff>3% max health<> true damage per stack and shorter cooldowns. Every 40s a full draw adds <#ffffffff>6%<>.",
        "skill2": "Rains arrows on an area: <#ff9028ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, bursting Blight. The ground stays corrupted for <#ffb900ff>4s<>: enemies in it are <#ef5350ff>slowed<> by 30% and healed 40% less.",
        "ult": "Flings a tendril at the first enemy champion: <#ff9028ff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, <#ef5350ff>rooted<> for <#ffb900ff>2s<>, full Blight. The corruption then spreads to enemy champions nearby, <#ef5350ff>rooting<> them for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>."
      },
      "league_tryndamere": {
        "name": "Tryndamere",
        "attack": "Sword strikes. Passive <#ff9028ff>Battle Fury<>: each enemy his attacks and Spinning Slash hit gives a stack of Fury, a kill two, up to 5; each stack is <#ffb900ff>+8%<> critical strike chance (crits deal double). Fury drains a stack a second once he stops for 5s.",
        "skill": "Spins through the target, dealing <#ff9028ff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>160%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to every enemy in his path and gaining a stack of Fury for each.",
        "skill2": "Mocks the enemy champions around him: <#ef5350ff>-25%<> attack for <#ffb900ff>4s<>. Those farther off, turning to run, are also <#ef5350ff>slowed<> by 40% for 2s.",
        "ult": "When two enemy champions are on him or the blows keep coming: full Fury, and for <#ffb900ff>5s<> his health cannot fall below 1. As it ends he casts <#ff9028ff>Bloodlust<>, spending his Fury to heal <#66bb6aff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#66bb6aff>30%<>, plus <#66bb6aff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#66bb6aff>10%<> per stack."
      },
      "league_xerath": {
        "name": "Xerath",
        "attack": "Fires arcane orbs. Passive <#ff9028ff>Mana Surge<>: every <#ffb900ff>14s<> his next attack deals <#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> bonus <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and cuts his basic spells' cooldowns by 23%. Each unit he kills brings it 3.5s sooner.",
        "skill": "Charges, then fires a piercing beam: <#a974ffff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>85%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to every enemy in the line. With an enemy champion near he charges fully for a longer beam; against minions alone a quick charge deals 65%.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Shocking Orb<>: the first enemy hit takes <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>45%<> and is <#ef5350ff>stunned<> for 0.75-2s (longer the farther it flew). Then the <#ff9028ff>Eye of Destruction<> falls on the enemy champion: <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> and a <#ef5350ff>slow<>, +67% in the centre.",
        "ult": "Ascends and channels in place, calling <#ffb900ff>4<> arcane shells down on distant enemy champions. Each lands after a warning for <#a974ffff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>45%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; every champion hit adds 20% to the shells after it. Crowd control breaks the channel."
      },
      "league_xinzhao": {
        "name": "Xin Zhao",
        "attack": "Spear thrusts. Passive <#ff9028ff>Determination<>: every third attack deals <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40%<> more physical damage and heals him <#66bb6aff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#66bb6aff>15%<>.",
        "skill": "Charges the target, dealing <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<> physical damage to nearby enemies and <#ef5350ff>slowing<> them by 30%; he gains 40% attack speed for <#ffb900ff>5s<>. Then <#ff9028ff>Three Talon Strike<>: his next 3 attacks deal <#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30%<> more, the third <#ef5350ff>knocks up<> for 0.75s.",
        "skill2": "Slashes in front of him for <#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40%<> physical damage, then thrusts ahead for <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>65%<> physical damage, <#ef5350ff>slowing<> by 50% for 1.5s.",
        "ult": "Sweeps around him for <#ff9028ff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> plus 10% of the target's max health as physical damage, <#ef5350ff>knocking back<> every enemy but the challenged one. For <#ffb900ff>3s<> afterwards he takes 40% less damage."
      },
      "league_samira": {
        "name": "Samira",
        "attack": "Shoots from range; in melee range she slashes for <#a974ffff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#a974ffff>20%<> bonus <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Daredevil Impulse<>: a champion hit by a move unlike her last raises her Style a grade, E to S, +3% move speed each; it resets after 9s without one. Attacking a champion in crowd control dashes her to it and <#ef5350ff>knock it up<> for 0.5s.",
        "skill": "With an enemy beside her she slashes in front of her, otherwise she shoots the first enemy in line: <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>130%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Wild Rush<>: dashes past an enemy champion, dealing <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#a974ffff>40%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> around her and gaining 30% attack speed. Then <#ff9028ff>Blade Whirl<>: spins for 0.75s, slashing twice for <#ff9028ff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<> each and taking 60% less damage from attacks. A champion kill refreshes the cooldown.",
        "ult": "Only at Style <#ffb900ff>S<>: spins in place firing for <#ffb900ff>2s<>, every 0.2s a shot at every enemy around her for <#ff9028ff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, with 40% life steal. Spends her Style."
      },
      "league_pyke": {
        "name": "Pyke",
        "attack": "Harpoon slashes. Passive <#ff9028ff>Gift of the Drowned Ones<>: hits store grey health (up to 5 stacks); camouflaged or unhit for 3s he heals <#66bb6aff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#66bb6aff>8%<> <#66bb6aff>health<> a stack. Little health growth, more attack damage growth.",
        "skill": "Stabs a champion beside him, otherwise charges and throws his harpoon at the first enemy: <#ff9028ff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, a 90% slow, and the harpoon <#ef5350ff>pulls<> it to him.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Ghostwater Dive<>: camouflage and a burst of speed, grey health healed. Then <#ff9028ff>Phantom Undertow<>: dashes through an enemy champion; a phantom rushes back to him, dealing <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to champions on its way and <#ef5350ff>stunning<> them for 1s.",
        "ult": "Strikes an X: champions take <#ffffffff>180<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ffffffff>60%<> <#ffffffff>true damage<> - below that they are <#ef5350ff>executed<>, otherwise they take half; other enemies take half as physical damage. A champion dying in the X blinks him to it and <#ffb900ff>refreshes the ult<>."
      },
      "league_gwen": {
        "name": "Gwen",
        "attack": "Passive <#ff9028ff>A Thousand Cuts<>: her attacks and skill hits deal <#a974ffff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>8%<> bonus <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; to champions also <#f5f5f5ff>1% max health true damage<>, healing her <#a974ffff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>6%<>. Each attack adds a snip stack (up to 4).",
        "skill": "Snips in front of her <#ffb900ff>1 + stacks<> times for <#a974ffff>12<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>8%<> each, then a final snip for <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; enemies in the centre take <#f5f5f5ff>25 true damage<> more. Every snip applies the passive. Cast within 2s of Skip 'n Slash landing, the centre is on the target.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Skip 'n Slash<>: dashes at an enemy champion, snipping it as she lands; for 4s her attacks gain 25% attack speed, range and <#a974ffff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>20%<> on hit. Where she lands <#ff9028ff>Hallowed Mist<> settles for 4s: inside it she is <#ffb900ff>invisible<> (enemies far away cannot target her) with +22 armour and magic resist.",
        "ult": "Hurls three volleys of needles at an enemy champion - 1, 3 and 5 needles - each dealing <#a974ffff>50/60/75<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>25%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, <#ef5350ff>slowing 40%<> for 1.5s and applying the passive. She can attack between the volleys."
      },
      "league_khazix": {
        "name": "Kha'Zix",
        "attack": "Claw strikes. Passive <#ff9028ff>Unseen Threat<>: after stealth or 4s without acting, his next attack on a champion deals <#a974ffff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>25%<> <#a974ffff>bonus damage<> and slows 25%. Evolves Q, E, R at <#ffb900ff>levels 5/8/11<>.",
        "skill": "Slashes for <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, or <#ff9028ff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>125%<> to a target with no allies nearby (<#ffb900ff>Isolated<>). <#ff9028ff>Reaper Claws<>: longer attack range; refunds cooldown on Isolated targets.",
        "skill2": "Leaps at an enemy champion, dealing <#ff9028ff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>35%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> on landing, then fires a <#ff9028ff>Void Spike<>: <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<>, a 40% slow, and heals him <#66bb6aff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#66bb6aff>15%<> if he is in the blast. <#ff9028ff>Wings<>: longer leap, reset on champion kills.",
        "ult": "Becomes <#ffb900ff>invisible for 1.25s<> with 40% move speed and <#ff9028ff>Unseen Threat<> ready; can be cast once more. <#ff9028ff>Adaptive Cloaking<>: <#ffb900ff>2s<>, three casts."
      },
      "league_brand": {
        "name": "Brand",
        "attack": "Passive <#ff9028ff>Blaze<>: his spells set enemies ablaze for 4s, dealing <#a974ffff>6<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>4%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> a second. Spell hits on champions stack; at 3 stacks that champion detonates 2s later for <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> + <#f5f5f5ff>4% max health<> damage round it.",
        "skill": "After a short delay a pillar of flame rises at the target, dealing <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>55%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to enemies in it and setting them ablaze; 25% more while a champion burns.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Conflagration<>: sets an enemy champion ablaze, spreading to those around it, for <#a974ffff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>35%<>. Then <#ff9028ff>Sear<>: a fireball hits the first enemy for <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>45%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, <#ef5350ff>stunning 0.83s<>. On a champion with Pillar of Flame ready, the pillar follows on him.",
        "ult": "A fireball bounces <#ffb900ff>5 times<> among enemies, champions first, each dealing <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>20%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, setting ablaze and <#ef5350ff>slowing 35%<>. Not cast on a target with no other enemy near."
      },
      "league_twitch": {
        "name": "Twitch",
        "attack": "Crossbow bolts. Passive <#ff9028ff>Deadly Venom<>: his attacks, the cask and R's bolts each add a stack of venom that deals <#ffffffff>1<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ffffffff>2%<> <#ffffffff>true damage<> per second for <#ffb900ff>6s<>.",
        "skill": "Camouflaged for up to <#ffb900ff>5s<> with 20% move speed; attacking or casting reveals him and grants 35% attack speed for <#ffb900ff>6s<>. Champion takedowns reset the cooldown.",
        "skill2": "Hurls a cask: enemies in the area gain a stack and are slowed 30%; the puddle lasts <#ffb900ff>3s<>. Then <#ff9028ff>Contaminate<>: every venom stack deals <#ff9028ff>6<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>16%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>.",
        "ult": "For <#ffb900ff>6s<>: +300 range and +15 attack; bolts pierce in a line, 10% less per unit hit (down to 60%). Cast with two enemy champions nearby."
      },
      "league_renekton": {
        "name": "Renekton",
        "attack": "Melee slashes. Passive <#ff9028ff>Reign of Anger<>: hits build Fury (up to 5 stacks, lost after <#ffb900ff>8s<> without a gain); at full Fury his next skill is empowered and spends it.",
        "skill": "Swings round him for <#ff9028ff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, healing for every enemy hit, more for champions. Empowered: <#ff9028ff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>140%<>, heals x3 (only while W is on cooldown).",
        "skill2": "Dashes through an enemy champion for <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<>, then <#ff9028ff>Ruthless Predator<>: two strikes and a <#ef5350ff>stun<> of <#ffb900ff>0.75s<> (empowered: three, <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>); Q if ready, then a second dash that, empowered, shreds 25% armour.",
        "ult": "Transforms when the fight starts, for <#ffb900ff>10s<>: +300 <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0>health, every <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> 15 + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0>1% <#a974ffff>magic damage<> round him, and Fury keeps building."
      },
      "league_seraphine": {
        "name": "Seraphine",
        "attack": "Passive <#ff9028ff>Stage Presence<>: every third spell <#ff9028ff>echoes<> (cast again). Each spell gives her a note, plus one for every allied champion near her (up to <#ffb900ff>4<>); her next attack deals <#a974ffff>8<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>8%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> per note, from a longer range.",
        "skill": "Drops a high note on the target: <#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to enemies in the area, 50% more to crowd-controlled champions.",
        "skill2": "A sound wave deals <#a974ffff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>35%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> in a line and <#ef5350ff>slows 30%<>; an echoed wave <#ef5350ff>roots<> slowed champions and <#ef5350ff>stuns<> crowd-controlled ones. Then <#ff9028ff>Surround Sound<>: allied champions near her gain a <#e8d44dff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#e8d44dff>25%<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> and <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>20% Move Speed<>; after <#ffb900ff>2.5s<> each heals <#6aff55ff>8<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#6aff55ff>6%<> per allied champion near.",
        "ult": "A sound wave that travels farther past an ally deals <#a974ffff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to enemy champions and <#ef5350ff>charms<> them for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>. Cast with two enemy champions near."
      },
      "league_viktor": {
        "name": "Viktor",
        "attack": "Passive <#ff9028ff>Glorious Evolution<>: at level <#ffb900ff>3<> Hextech Ray leaves an aftershock, at <#ffb900ff>5<> Siphon Power's shield grows and gives <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>30% Move Speed<>, at <#ffb900ff>7<> his spells <#ef5350ff>slow 20%<>, at <#ffb900ff>9<> the storm grows and lasts longer when it moves on.",
        "skill": "A bolt deals <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>45%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and gives him a <#e8d44dff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#e8d44dff>20%<> <#e8d44dff>shield<>; his next attack within <#ffb900ff>4s<> deals <#a974ffff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>45%<> bonus <#a974ffff>magic damage<>.",
        "skill2": "First a <#ff9028ff>Gravity Field<> under an enemy champion <#ef5350ff>slows 35%<> and <#ef5350ff>stuns<> enemies still inside after <#ffb900ff>1.25s<> for <#ffb900ff>1.25s<>. Then a Hextech Ray from the target on away from him deals <#a974ffff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>.",
        "ult": "A storm lands on an enemy champion for <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, then deals <#a974ffff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>15%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> a second round him for <#ffb900ff>6s<>, moving on to a champion near when he dies."
      }
    },
